  "title": "Russellian panpsychism",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "b00827db-5ade-4404-8e3c-e627c75edc28",
      "text": "Russellian panpsychism holds that some quiddities, the categorical properties that play the roles physics describes such as the mass role, are microphenomenal properties. One thesis then answers two questions: where consciousness fits in nature, and what underlies physical structure.",
